This product is a Rust port of AquaCrop-OSPy
(https://github.com/aquacropos/aquacrop), version 3.1.0, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. AquaCrop-OSPy is the work of Tim Foster,
Thomas Kelly and its contributors.

The crop parameter table (data/crop_params.json) and the CO2 concentration
series (data/co2/) are taken unchanged from AquaCrop-OSPy 3.1.0.

The source files under src/ were translated from the corresponding
AquaCrop-OSPy Python modules (aquacrop/entities, aquacrop/initialize,
aquacrop/solution, aquacrop/timestep and aquacrop/core.py). Changes from the
original are the translation itself and the places marked "Deviation:" in
the source, where the port returns an error or takes a defined branch where
AquaCrop-OSPy raises an exception.

AquaCrop-OSPy is not an official implementation of the FAO AquaCrop model,
and neither is this port.
